<div class="production-page">
<section class="page-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Production</p><h1>Manufacturing</h1><p>Plan materials, approve a bill of materials, and record what actually enters and leaves production.</p></div></section>
<nav class="button-row"><% if(canOperate){ %><a class="btn btn--primary" href="/manufacturing/boms/new">New BOM</a><a class="btn" href="/manufacturing/work-orders/new">New work order</a><% } %><a class="btn" href="/manufacturing/planning">Material planning</a></nav>
<section class="section"><h2>Production accounting</h2><p>Use a separate asset account for work in progress. Components move there at their recorded inventory cost; finished goods and recorded losses clear it.</p>
 <% if(canPost){ %><form method="post" action="/manufacturing/settings" class="form-stack"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><label class="rm-field"><span>Work-in-progress asset account</span><select name="wipAccountId" required><option value="">Choose an account</option><% accounts.forEach(a=>{ %><option value="<%= a.id %>" <%= settings?.wip_account_id===a.id?'selected':'' %>><%= a.code %> · <%= a.name %></option><% }) %></select></label><p><a href="/accounting/accounts">Manage accounts</a></p><button class="btn" type="submit">Save production accounting</button></form><% } %>
</section>
<section class="section"><h2>Work orders</h2><% if(!jobs.length){ %><p>No production work orders yet.</p><% } %><p class="table-hint">On a small screen, swipe the table sideways to see all columns.</p><div class="table-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Work orders" tabindex="0"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Work order</th><th>Product</th><th>Planned</th><th>Finished</th><th>Scrapped</th><th>Needed by</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody><% jobs.forEach(j=>{ %><tr><td><a href="/manufacturing/work-orders/<%= j.id %>"><%= j.order_number %></a></td><td><%= j.name %> · <%= j.code %></td><td><%= j.quantity %></td><td><%= j.good_quantity %></td><td><%= j.scrap_quantity %></td><td><%= j.needed_by %></td><td><%= j.status.replaceAll('_',' ') %></td></tr><% }) %></tbody></table></div><small>Showing the latest 100 work orders.</small></section>
<section class="section"><h2>Bills of materials</h2><ul><% boms.forEach(b=>{ %><li><a href="/manufacturing/boms/<%= b.id %>"><%= b.name %> · <%= b.code %> · revision <%= b.revision %></a> — <%= b.status.toLowerCase() %></li><% }) %></ul><small>Showing the latest 100 revisions. Work orders retain their original revision.</small></section>
<section class="section"><h2>Work centres</h2><ul><% centres.forEach(c=>{ %><li><%= c.name %> · <%= c.capacity_minutes_per_day %> minutes per day</li><% }) %></ul>
<% if(canApprove){ %><form method="post" action="/manufacturing/centres" class="form-stack"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><label class="rm-field"><span>Work centre name</span><input name="name" required maxlength="120"></label><label class="rm-field"><span>Available minutes per day</span><input name="capacityMinutesPerDay" type="number" min="1" max="1440" value="480" required></label><button class="btn">Add work centre</button></form><% } %></section>

</div>
